%N A378021 Decimal expansion of Pi*G - 33*zeta(3)/16, where G = A006752.
%D A378021 Steven R. Finch, Mathematical Constants, Encyclopedia of Mathematics and its Applications, vol. 94, Cambridge University Press, 2003, Section 1.7.2, p. 55.
%H A378021 Chunli Li and Wenchang Chu, <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/math12040589">Evaluating infinite series involving harmonic numbers by integration</a>, Mathematics, Vol. 12, No. 4 (2024), Article 589. See p. 8, eq. (18).
%F A378021 Equals Sum_{n>=1} (-1)^(n+1)/n^2 Sum_{k=1..n} 1/(k + n) (see Finch).
%F A378021 Equals Sum_{k>=1} (-1)^(k+1) * AH(2*k)/k^2, where AH(k) = A058313(k)/A058312(k) is the k-th alternating harmonic (or skew-harmonic) number (Li and Chu, 2024). - _Amiram Eldar_, Aug 23 2026
